,"s":["H4294"]},{"t":" Zebulun, twelve cities."}]},{"n":64,"text":"The children of Israel gave to the Levites the cities with their pasture lands.","tok":[{"t":"The children "},{"t":"of","s":["H4054"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Israel gave "},{"t":"to","s":["H6932"]},{"t":" the Levites the cities with their "},{"t":"pasture","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lands","s":["H4054"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":65,"text":"They gave by lot out of the tribe of the children of Judah, and out of the tribe of the children of Simeon, and out of the tribe of the children of Benjamin, these cities which are mentioned by name.","tok":[{"t":"They gave by lot "},{"t":"out","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tribe","s":["H4294"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" children "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" Judah, "},{"t":"and","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"out","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tribe","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" children "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" Simeon, "},{"t":"and","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"out","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tribe","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1410"]},{"t":" children "},{"t":"of","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" Benjamin, these cities which "},{"t":"are","s":["H4294"]},{"t":" mentioned by name."}]},{"n":66,"text":"Some of the families of the sons of Kohath had cities of their borders out of the tribe of Ephraim.","tok":[{"t":"Some "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" families "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" sons "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" Kohath had cities "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" their borders "},{"t":"out","s":["H4054"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" tribe "},{"t":"of","s":["H3270"]},{"t":" Ephraim."}]},{"n":67,"text":"They gave to them the cities of refuge, Shechem in the hill country of Ephraim with its pasture lands and Gezer with its pasture lands,"},{"n":68,"text":"Jokmeam with its pasture lands, Beth Horon with its pasture lands,"},{"n":69,"text":"Aijalon with its pasture lands, Gath Rimmon with its pasture lands;"},{"n":70,"text":"and out of the half-tribe of Manasseh, Aner with its pasture lands, and Bileam with its pasture lands, for the rest of the family of the sons of Kohath."},{"n":71,"text":"To the sons of Gershom were given, out of the family of the half-tribe of Manasseh, Golan in Bashan with its pasture lands, and Ashtaroth with its pasture lands;"},{"n":72,"text":"and out of the tribe of Issachar, Kedesh with its pasture lands, Daberath with its pasture lands,"},{"n":73,"text":"Ramoth with its pasture lands, and Anem with its pasture lands;"},{"n":74,"text":"and out of the tribe of Asher, Mashal with its pasture lands, Abdon with its pasture lands,"},{"n":75,"text":"Hukok with its pasture lands, and Rehob with its pasture lands;"},{"n":76,"text":"and out of the tribe of Naphtali, Kedesh in Galilee with its pasture lands, Hammon with its pasture lands, and Kiriathaim with its pasture lands."},{"n":77,"text":"To the rest of the Levites, the sons of Merari, were given, out of the tribe of Zebulun, Rimmono with its pasture lands, and Tabor with its pasture lands;"},{"n":78,"text":"and beyond the Jordan at Jericho, on the east side of the Jordan, were given them out of the tribe of Reuben: Bezer in the wilderness with its pasture lands, Jahzah with its pasture lands,"},{"n":79,"text":"Kedemoth with its pasture lands, and Mephaath with its pasture lands;"},{"n":80,"text":"and out of the tribe of Gad, Ramoth in Gilead with its pasture lands, Mahanaim with its pasture lands,"},{"n":81,"text":"Heshbon with its pasture lands, and Jazer with its pasture lands."}]}
